		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event1_hero_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>にげおくれた　おんな『ありがとう！
おかげで　たすかったわ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>逃げ遅れた　女『ありがとう！
おかげで　助かったわ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event1_hero_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『ここは　きけんです！
はやく　にげて　ください！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『ここは　危険です！
早く　逃げて　ください！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event1_hero_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>にげおくれた　おんな『ええ！
でも　あなたも　きを　つけて！▼
さっき　UFOが　人や　ポケモンを
つれさっていく　ところを　みたわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>逃げ遅れた　女『ええ！
でも　あなたも　気を　つけて！▼
さっき　UFOが　人や　ポケモンを
連れ去っていく　所を　見たわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event1_hero_3"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なんですって……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
