	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event6_hero_4"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『……　ちがう▼
……　あの　UFOは
にげたわけでは　ない……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『……　違う▼
……　あの　UFOは
逃げたわけでは　ない……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
